<title>USA: Portugal PM sees falling deficit, economy too slow.</title>
<headline>Portugal PM sees falling deficit, economy too slow.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese Prime Minister Antonio Guterres said his nation's government deficit will fall below 3.0 percent next year.</p>
<p>&quot;Our public deficit is going down very quickly and will be below three percent next year, I'm sure,&quot; said Guterres, speaking to investors in New York.</p>
</text>
